Diagnostics management commands

Usage: souc diagnostics [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  check    Check a file and show diagnostics with rich formatting
  similar  Show similar names for typo detection
  render   Test diagnostic rendering
  stats    Show diagnostic statistics for a file
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -v, --verbose  Enable verbose output
  -h, --help     Print help
